<http://purl.org/cpr/biological-process> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Those processes which either take place within the human organism or\n            are processes of causal interaction in which the human organism is involved." .
<http://purl.org/cpr/biological-process> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/cpr/biological-process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Biological process" .
<http://purl.org/cpr/biological-process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ifomis.org/bfo/1.1/span#ProcessualEntity> .
<http://purl.org/cpr/idiopathic-disease> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> ".. relating to or denoting any disease or condition that arises spontaneously or for which the cause is unknown" .
<http://purl.org/cpr/idiopathic-disease> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
