<http://purl.org/cpr/pathological-disposition> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A disposition (i) to undergo pathological processes that (ii) exists in an organism\n            caused by one or more etiologic agents (iii) typically involving an identifiable group of signs and symptoms\n            and (iv) consistent physiological or anatomical alterations" .
<http://purl.org/cpr/pathological-disposition> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
